      + " &middot; generated "
      + esc(time.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M")) + "</p>")
    a('<p class="lede">The moment a nucleus decays is not determined by '
      "anything, which makes a Geiger&ndash;M&uuml;ller counter the textbook "
